title: "There Is Always a Master"
subtitle: The Jedi have learned something they would rather not share.
tags: event
view-if: naboo_free and date >= 19
max-visits: 1
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_jedi.svg
on-arrival: sith_told = 1 if jedi_relation >= 55 or adv_organa = 1; evidence += 1 if sith_told

= "There Is Always a Master"

[? if sith_told : Master Yoda receives a small Caucus delegation in a quiet room of the Jedi Temple. He confirms what the rumours say: the warrior on Naboo was a Sith Lord. "Always two there are," he says. "A master and an apprentice. Destroyed, the apprentice was. The master, hidden he remains." ?][? if not sith_told : Rumours leak out of the Jedi Temple: the warrior killed on Naboo was a Sith. The Order neither confirms nor denies anything. Our contacts in the Temple say the Council is badly shaken. ?]

- @confide: Keep the Jedi's confidence and quietly offer our help.
- @push: Press the Council to investigate where the Sith might be hiding, including the Senate.
- @leak: Make it public: the Republic deserves to know.

@confide
subtitle: The Jedi will trust us more.
on-arrival: jedi_relation += 5

The Caucus keeps the secret. The Jedi notice.

@push
subtitle: The Jedi will investigate, and resent being pushed.
on-arrival: jedi_suspicion += 1; jedi_relation -= 3; senate_resolve += 0.3

The Council agrees, coolly, to "remain vigilant". A small group of Jedi archivists begins quietly reviewing the Senate's records.

@leak
subtitle: Fear will spread. The Jedi will be furious.
on-arrival: fear += 5; jedi_relation -= 10; jedi_standing -= 3; pal_relation += 2; core_pal += 1; colonies_pal += 1

The HoloNet runs with "SITH RETURN!" for a week. Senator Palpatine calls for calm and for "a government strong enough to protect us". Many find this very reassuring.
